<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>We've Worked on Projects With on My Discombobulated Brain</title><link>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/</link><description>Recent content in We've Worked on Projects With on My Discombobulated Brain</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-GB</language><atom:link href="https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Cardiff Medical School</title><link>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/cardiff-medical-school/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/cardiff-medical-school/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Laura does a lot of work with Cardiff University Medical School. She is a regular speaker at the Winter and Summer School of Psychiatry Medical Day. She also leads sessions on Psychiatry and Mental Health in Film as a service user and Charity Founder.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>PHA Group</title><link>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/pha-group/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/pha-group/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Gov UK</title><link>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/gov-uk/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/gov-uk/</guid><description/></item><item><title>MMA</title><link>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/mma/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/mma/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;We work with Phil Raeburn who is an MMA fighter training out of SBG in Ireland. Phil trains alongside John Phillips and Connor McGregor. Phil publicly speaks about his mental health.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>NCMH</title><link>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/ncmh/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/ncmh/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Laura’s work with NCMH is very personal and varied, but we would like to talk about a few collaborations. Laura went to Time to Talk London on 5th February 2015 with Prof Ian Jones. She is a prominent Research Champion for them, promoting their DNA database and research.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Laura was honoured to be the first guest on the first NCMH podcast and collaborates with them and Tilly Ellis, one of our trustees, annually with the Express Yourself art show, which happens on University Mental Health Day.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Newport County AFC</title><link>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/newport-county-afc/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/newport-county-afc/</guid><description/></item><item><title>1000 Lives</title><link>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/1000-lives/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/1000-lives/</guid><description/></item><item><title>BBC</title><link>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/bbc/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/bbc/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Our Founder, Laura Jane Dernie, was featured on the &lt;a href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/av/uk-wales-35608141"&gt;BBC’s ‘In The Mind’ &lt;/a&gt;series talking about Peri and Postnatal Depression.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>BIRSt logo</title><link>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/birst-logo/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/birst-logo/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Our founder, Laura Jane Dernie, featured on &lt;a href="http://www.birst.co.uk/bammj-takeover/"&gt;Bournemouth University Radio’s talk show&lt;/a&gt; with &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/DrAndyMayers"&gt;Dr Andrew Mayers&lt;/a&gt;, Open Your Mind: A Mental Health Discussion, on 17th March 2016,&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Found Festival</title><link>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/found-festival/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/found-festival/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Go Connect</title><link>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/go-connect/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/go-connect/</guid><description/></item><item><title>GreenMan Festival</title><link>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/greenman-festival/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/greenman-festival/</guid><description/></item><item><title>HMS</title><link>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/hms/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/hms/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Holland and Barrett Magazine</title><link>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/holland-and-barrett-magazine/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/holland-and-barrett-magazine/</guid><description/></item><item><title>House of Commons</title><link>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/house-of-commons/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/house-of-commons/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Laura spoke at a Perinatal Event at the House of Commons on 20th November 2017.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>IANLPC</title><link>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/ianlpc/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/ianlpc/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Ignite Cardi