1 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/science-cafe-bbc-radio-wales/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Our Founder, Laura Jane Dernie, was featured alongside the NCMH team on &lt;a href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/programmes/b079rpd8"&gt;Science Cafe on BBC Radio Wales.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Senedd Cymru, Welsh Parliament</title><link>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/senedd-cymru-welsh-parliament/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/senedd-cymru-welsh-parliament/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Welsh Government’s inquiry into Perinatal Mental Health 2017&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Sense</title><link>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/sense/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/sense/</guid><description/></item><item><title>South Wales Echo</title><link>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/south-wales-echo/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/south-wales-echo/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Our Founder, Laura Jane Dernie has been in several articles in the South Wales Echo about Peri and Post Natal Depression and her work with the National Centre of Wales.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>St Teilos</title><link>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/st-teilos/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/st-teilos/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Studio Hicks</title><link>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/studio-hicks/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/studio-hicks/</guid><description/></item><item><title>The Royal Collage of Midwives</title><link>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/the-royal-collage-of-midwives/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/the-royal-collage-of-midwives/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Laura spoke at The Royal College of Midwifery Conference on 27 April 2017 in City Hall, Cardiff. Since then, she has spoken at several midwifery events with The Royal College.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>University of South Wales</title><link>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/university-of-south-wales/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/university-of-south-wales/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Wellnergy</title><link>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/wellnergy/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/wellnergy/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Welsh I.C.E</title><link>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/welsh-i.c.e/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/welsh-i.c.e/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Welsh Liberal Democrats</title><link>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/welsh-liberal-democrats/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://stephlocke.com/my-discombobulated-brain/worked-with/welsh-liberal-democrats/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;On 1st March 2015 Laura spoke at the Welsh Liberal Democrats Conference about how Mental Health research and real stories were very important.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Western Mail</title><link>https://stephlocke.co